{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34267","headline":"五歌 食鱼 · 陆龟蒙","name":"五歌 食鱼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南春旱鱼无泽，岁晏未曾腥鼎鬲。\n今朝有客卖鲈鲂，手提见我长於尺。\n呼儿舂取红莲米，轻重相当加十倍。\n且作吴羹助早餐，饱卧晴檐曝寒背。\n横戈负羽正纷纷，祗用骁雄不用文。\n争如晓夕讴吟样，好伴沧洲白鸟羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}